    comptime assert not (is_defined["MOJOLEARN_RSVD_FAST_DIRECT_IN_OFF"]() or is_defined["MOJOLEARN_IDN_RSVD_DIRECT_IN_OFF"]()), "removed 2026-11-08 (lane a3-admit-decomp-prep-metrics): MOJOLEARN_RSVD_FAST_DIRECT_IN and MOJOLEARN_IDN_RSVD_DIRECT_IN (randomized_svd's input straight to the device; KEPT defaults, M3 istella 517.3 -> 501.3 ms) and MOJOLEARN_RSVD_FAST_DEVSCAN (its finiteness scan on the device copy; KEPT, rab15 istella 490.1 -> 435.1 ms with ORTH_WS) were superseded: randomized_svd is one driver that reads M in place and uploads it once, and its admission scans in parallel on the host; no route is left to roll back to; code at f7d10d2b09; see docs/TOMBSTONES.md"
